<title>SLOVAKIA: SLOVAK CHEMOLAK SKK 75.89 MLN 9MO NET.</title>
<headline>SLOVAK CHEMOLAK SKK 75.89 MLN 9MO NET.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for nine-month period</p>
<p>ending September 30, 1996:</p>
<p>(in million crowns)</p>
<p> After-tax profit	 75.887		89.506</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	  126.479	     149.177</p>
<p> Operating revenues  1,453.090	   1,426.730</p>
<p> Operating costs     1,286.079	   1,214.598</p>
<p> Operating profit	167.011	     212.132</p>
<p>Profit from regular</p>
<p>  activities	     126.497	     149.479</p>
<p>Revenues from financial</p>
<p>  operations		26.060		 6.995</p>
<p> Financial costs	  65.058		69.648</p>
<p>Result from financial</p>
<p>  operations	     -38.998	     -62.653</p>
<p> Basic Capital	   501.620	     501.620</p>
<p> Total assets	  1,753.676	    1,554.268</p>
<p>Note. Full company name is Chemolak a.s. Smolenice. The</p>
<p>company is Slovakia's largest paint producer. Its shares are</p>
<p>listed on the Bratislava Stock Exchange (BSE). Results are</p>
<p>provided by the BSE.</p>
<p>-- Bratislava Newsroom, 42-7-563-3687</p>
</text>
